{
  "name": "Telegram Task Reminder Bot",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "updates": ["message"],
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "name": "Telegram Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegramTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [250, 300],
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const items = $input.all();\nconst results = [];\nfor (const item of items) {\n  const text = item.json.message?.text || '';\n  const chatId = item.json.message?.chat?.id;\n  const userId = item.json.message?.from?.id;\n  const username = item.json.message?.from?.username || 'user';\n  \n  // Parse: /remind <text> at <HH:MM>\n  const match = text.match(/^\\/remind\\s+(.+?)\\s+at\\s+(\\d{1,2}:\\d{2})$/i);\n  if (match) {\n    const reminderText = match[1].trim();\n    const [hour, minute] = match[2].split(':').map(Number);\n    const now = new Date();\n    const remindAt = new Date(now.getFullYear(), now.getMonth(), now.getDate(), hour, minute);\n    if (remindAt <= now) remindAt.setDate(remindAt.getDate() + 1);\n    results.push({\n      json: {\n        command: 'create',\n        reminderText,\n        remindAt: remindAt.toISOString(),\n        hour, minute,\n        chatId, userId, username,\n        status: 'pending',\n        createdAt: now.toISOString()\n      }\n    });\n  } else if (text.startsWith('/list')) {\n    results.push({ json: { command: 'list', chatId, userId, username } });\n  } else {\n    results.push({ json: { command: 'unknown', chatId } });\n  }\n}\nreturn results;"
      },
      "name": "Parse Command",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [500, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rules": {
          "rules": [
            { "outputKey": "create", "value": "create" },
            { "outputKey": "list", "value": "list" },
            { "outputKey": "unknown", "value": "unknown" }
          ]
        },
        "dataType": "string",
        "value1": "={{$json.command}}"
      },
      "name": "Route Command",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.switch",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [750, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": { "value": "" },
        "sheetName": { "value": "Reminders" },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "autoMapInputData",
          "value": {}
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Save Reminder",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [1000, 150],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "",
          "name": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{$json.chatId}}",
        "text": "=⏰ Reminder set!\n📝 {{$json.reminderText}}\n🕐 Will remind at {{$json.hour}}:{{$json.minute}}",
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "name": "Confirm Created",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [1250, 150],
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "getAll",
        "documentId": { "value": "" },
        "sheetName": { "value": "Reminders" },
        "filters": {},
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Get User Reminders",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [1000, 300],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "",
          "name": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const items = $input.all();\nconst pending = items.filter(i => i.json.status === 'pending');\nlet text = '📋 <b>Your Pending Reminders:</b>\\n\\n';\nif (pending.length === 0) {\n  text += 'No pending reminders.';\n} else {\n  pending.forEach((item, idx) => {\n    text += `${idx + 1}. ${item.json.reminderText} - ⏰ ${item.json.remindAt}\\n`;\n  });\n}\nreturn [{ json: { text, chatId: pending[0]?.json.chatId || '' } }];"
      },
      "name": "Format List",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1250, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{$json.chatId}}",
        "text": "={{$json.text}}",
        "additionalFields": { "parse_mode": "HTML" }
      },
      "name": "Send List",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [1500, 300],
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{$json.chatId}}",
        "text": "❓ Unknown command. Use:\n/remind <task> at <HH:MM>\n/list - show pending reminders",
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "name": "Send Help",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [1000, 500],
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            { "field": "minutes", "minutesInterval": 1 }
          ]
        }
      },
      "name": "Check Every Minute",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [250, 700]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "getAll",
        "documentId": { "value": "" },
        "sheetName": { "value": "Reminders" },
        "filters": {},
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Read All Reminders",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [500, 700],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "",
          "name": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const items = $input.all();\nconst now = new Date();\nconst due = items.filter(i => {\n  if (i.json.status !== 'pending') return false;\n  const remindAt = new Date(i.json.remindAt);\n  return remindAt <= now;\n});\nif (due.length === 0) return [];\nreturn due.map(i => ({ json: { ...i.json, status: 'done' } }));"
      },
      "name": "Filter Due Reminders",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [750, 700]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{$json.chatId}}",
        "text": "=🔔 <b>REMINDER!</b>\n\n📝 {{$json.reminderText}}\n\nSet by @{{$json.username}}",
        "additionalFields": { "parse_mode": "HTML" }
      },
      "name": "Send Reminder",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [1000, 700],
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Telegram Task Reminder Bot\n\n**Commands:**\n- `/remind <task> at <HH:MM>` — create a reminder\n- `/list` — show pending reminders\n\n**Flows:**\n1. User command → parse → create/list/help\n2. Every minute → check due reminders → send alerts\n\n**Setup:**\n1. Set Telegram Bot API credentials\n2. Create Google Sheet: reminderText, remindAt, hour, minute, chatId, userId, username, status, createdAt",
        "width": 450,
        "height": 250
      },
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [250, 900]
    }
  ],
